    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="67.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 67.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="67.2" corresp="#wit-h">Gif heo bið þurhþyrel, þonne scel þær XXX scll' to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="67.2" corresp="#wit-e">Gif hio bið ðurhðyrel, ðon<hi rend="italic">ne</hi> sceal ðær XXX scill. to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="67.2" corresp="#wit-q">Si transpuncti sunt, id componant XXX sol.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" n="71.2" corresp="#wit-e">Gif hio bið ðurhðyrel, ðon<hi rend="italic">ne</hi> sceal ðær XXX scill to bote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#jurasinski-and-oliver" corresp="#wit-e">If it is pierced through, then 30 shillings shall be compensation for that.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-e">If it is pierced right through, then 30 shillings must be paid as compensation for it.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn sie durchbohrt ist, dann gebührt da 30 Schill. zur Busse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If it is pierced through, then 30 shillings are due as compensation.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
